{
    "title": "Christian Connection - Dating",
    "description": "Christian Connection is the multi-award-winning dating app that has been connecting single Christians for 20 years. Many thousands have already found love on Christian Connection and many more are joining and discovering why it\u2019s the best place to meet other Christians.\r\n\r\nJoin today for free and you\u2019ll be able to:\r\n\r\n \u2022 See ALL the Christian members in your area\r\n \u2022 Discover lots of new members that join every day\r\n \u2022 Enjoy no limits on your daily matches\r\n \u2022 See who likes you before you like them first\r\n \u2022 Read and reply to your messages on the go\r\n \u2022 Decide who can contact you with our new Search Visibility feature\r\n \u2022 Chat in real-time with others who are online\r\n \u2022 Be confident knowing that all profiles are checked and verified by our dedicated team\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re serious about finding a Christian partner, then download the app now and start connecting with single Christians near you. Existing members can just log in and go straight to your messages.\r\n\r\nStart your own story on Christian Connection today.\r\n\r\n#StartsWithFaith\r\n\r\n\r\nHERE\u2019S HOW IT WORKS:\r\n\r\n 1. Sign up for free in just a few seconds\r\n 2. Answer a few questions about what makes you, you\r\n 3. Tell us about the person you\u2019re looking for\r\n 4. Discover other local Christians who share your values\r\n 5. Send a message, or a \u2018wave\u2019 to get the conversation started\r\n 6. Meet up and get to know each other in person\r\n 7. Join our community of thousands of success stories!\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, our dedicated team is standing by to help - just email help@christianconnection.com. \r\n\r\n\r\nABOUT CHRISTIAN CONNECTION\r\n\r\nWe are a dedicated team of Christians, leading the way in Christian dating for 20 years and counting. We have unmatched success at bringing people of faith together and are proud to have connected many thousands of Christians for long-lasting relationships.\r\n\r\nWe are often featured on TV, Radio and the media - speaking out about Christian relationships, singleness, and faith.\r\n\r\nWe have won over 15 awards, including Daters\u2019 Favourite Dating Site, Best Customer Service, Best Niche Site; awarded by The Dating Awards, iDate International and the Good Website Guide.\r\n\r\nChristian Connection has members all over the United States and come from a wide array of faith traditions, including Anglican, Apostolic, Assembly of God, Baptist, Brethren, Calvinistic Baptist, Catholic, Catholic-Charismatic, Christian Reformed, Church of Christ, Church of God, Episcopalian, Evangelical, House Church, Lutheran, Mennonite, Messianic, Methodist, Missionary Alliance, Missionary Church, Nazarene, Non-denominational, Orthodox, Pentecostal-Charismatic, Presbyterian, Quaker, Reformed Baptist, Reformed Presbyterian, Salvation Army, 7th Day Adventist. Southern Baptist, United, and United Pentecostal Church.\r\n\r\nFull terms and conditions can be found at https://www.christianconnection.com/terms",
