ong-lasting relationships.<br><br>We are often featured on TV, Radio and the media - speaking out about Christian relationships, singleness, and faith.<br><br>We have won over 15 awards, including Daters\u2019 Favourite Dating Site, Best Customer Service, Best Niche Site; awarded by The Dating Awards, iDate International and the Good Website Guide.<br><br>Christian Connection has members all over the United States and come from a wide array of faith traditions, including Anglican, Apostolic, Assembly of God, Baptist, Brethren, Calvinistic Baptist, Catholic, Catholic-Charismatic, Christian Reformed, Church of Christ, Church of God, Episcopalian, Evangelical, House Church, Lutheran, Mennonite, Messianic, Methodist, Missionary Alliance, Missionary Church, Nazarene, Non-denominational, Orthodox, Pentecostal-Charismatic, Presbyterian, Quaker, Reformed Baptist, Reformed Presbyterian, Salvation Army, 7th Day Adventist. Southern Baptist, United, and United Pentecostal Church.<br><br>Full terms and conditions can be found at https://www.christianconnection.com/terms",
